{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act47side_level_act47side_03_end","storyGroup":"act47side","storySort":7,"storyDependence":"act47side_level_act47side_03_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"UR-3","storyName":"跌落保护","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"得到高登帮助的“幸运瘤兽”得以留在园区，但斯凯敏锐地从他们的设施中察觉到了异常。另一边，逃跑的两人被追兵意外炸进了高登的秘密收藏室——这里藏着高登用来帮助“幸运瘤兽”和其他许多企业的违禁走私品。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act47side/level_act47side_03_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act47side_03","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":5,"next":7,"characters":["斯凯","雅斯彭","娜斯提","缪尔赛思","资深研究员","地下研究员","电子声","园区警卫A","体验员","园区警卫B","费尔南","奥克里","高登","太空鳞兽","？？？","？？","高登&费尔南"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"charslot","id":5},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_bg_68_g5_floatingstation.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":6},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$loading_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_sys_loading_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":7,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":8},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":9},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":10},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#4$1","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":11},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"……","id":12,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#4$1","id":13},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"优胜劣汰，园区准则……莱茵什么时候也被归到淘汰者的队伍里了？","id":14,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":15},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkfast","volume":"1","id":16},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#1$1","posfrom":"300,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1","id":17},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":18},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown3","volume":"1","id":19},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#4$1","focus":"n","id":20},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","afrom":"1","ato":"1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-60,0","duration":"0.4","focus":"m","isblock":"false","id":21},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"20","randomness":"70","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":22},{"type":"delay","time":"1.2","id":23},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","afrom":"1","ato":"1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"60,0","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":24},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":25},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","isblock":"true","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"抱歉……呃，斯凯先生？你怎么在这里！","id":27},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"这话应该我来问吧？“幸运瘤兽”应该已经办完进驻资质注销手续了，你在这儿干嘛？","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"我没有利用任何非法途径！在注销进驻资质前，我们靠自己解决了技术难题，实在太幸运了……","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0d/Avg_avg_npc_2041_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"解决了？为什么没有人通报工程部？","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"可能是事出突然，交接上出了问题……","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7e/Avg_avg_npc_2041_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"再、再说了，刚刚高登长官都在广播里通报了——莱茵生命主导的工程检修全面暂停。","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7e/Avg_avg_npc_2041_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅斯彭","text":"现在，我也不需要向你汇报了吧？","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_npc_2041_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"……","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":42},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","id":43},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2041_1#1$1","posfrom":"70,0","posto":"-30,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.8","isblock":"true","id":44},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":45},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"三天都没法解决的问题，突然就搞定了？","id":46,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"幸运的“幸运瘤兽”吗……","id":48,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":49},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":50},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":51},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9e/Avg_bg_68_g6_floatinglabmodule.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":52},{"type":"charslot","id":53},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":54},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":55},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":56},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"快点，读数，快点！他们的人指不定什么时候就回来了……","id":57,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":58},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"……数据完全达标。不如说达标得有点太精准了，简直像是对着标准刻意调整过一样。","id":59,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":60},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"嗯？这几个……不是园区通用的螺丝型号吧？","id":61,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":62},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"拧不动。完全焊住了……整个核心动力装置都被封死了。","id":63,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":64},{"type":"charslot","id":65},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_energywell","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"en","id":66},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.5","channel":"en","fadetime":"2","id":67},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":68},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":69},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"……但我听也能听出来，园区允许使用的动力元件里，没有任何一个型号的能发出这种声响。","id":70,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d6/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"stopsound","fadetime":"2","channel":"en","id":71},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"他们是从哪搞来的这种不合规的奇怪元件？园区所有零件的采购权不是都归——","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"哈……原来是这样，我还以为园区的准则真的是优胜劣汰。","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/44/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":76},{"type":"charslot","id":77},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_makephonecall","id":78},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":79},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_telephonebusy","id":80},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":81},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"……忙着帮那个混蛋整理莱茵的事故报告吗？","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"算了，就算上报给娜斯提主任，她也会质疑我没有证据。","id":85,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"还有谁能帮我……","id":87,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":88},{"type":"dialog","id":89},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":90},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":91},{"type":"charslot","id":92},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_bg_29_g9_headquarter.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":93},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"1","block":"true","id":94},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":95},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$warm_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_warm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":96,"musicid":1},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":97},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"3","keep":"true","initamount":"1","amount":"0","block":"true","id":98},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"char_249_muesys_1#1","duration":"1.5","id":99},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#4$1","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":100},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":101},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"我的车还有五分钟到。要是实验园区有吉祥物玩偶，我会给你带一个。","id":102,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"char_249_muesys_1#4","focus":"r","id":103},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"我可不是需要人哄的小孩子。","id":104,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_char_249_muesys_4.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"那再见？","id":106,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"char_249_muesys_1#5","focus":"r","id":107},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"你从塞雷娅办公室出来之后，就一直待在走廊里跟你的“树枝”玩抛接球。","id":108,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_char_249_muesys_5.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"char_249_muesys_1#4","focus":"r","id":109},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"故意拖延时间不见我？我都看到了哦。","id":110,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_char_249_muesys_4.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":111},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"利用水分身侵犯个人隐私应当被追究法律责任。","id":112,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"char_249_muesys_1#5","focus":"r","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"在哥伦比亚出现第二个水精灵之前，你无处申诉。","id":114,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_char_249_muesys_5.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":115},{"type":"charslot","id":116},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_swordwhoosh","volume":"1","id":117},{"type":"text","text":"话音刚落，娜斯提腰间的“树枝”突然向上伸长了一截，枝端对准水精灵的方向，旋开工具片。","id":118},{"type":"dialog","id":119},{"type":"charslot","id":120},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"0.6","id":121},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_249_mlyss_1#11$1","id":122},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":123},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_muesys_hide","layer":"4","rox":"-7","roy":"79","roz":"100","id":124},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_watersubbreak","volume":"0.7","id":125},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_249_mlyss_1#11$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"80,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.3","isblock":"true","id":126},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":127},{"type":"text","text":"缪尔赛思像排练了无数次一般朝右移了一步，躲开仿生树枝机器人的恶作剧。","id":128},{"type":"dialog","id":129},{"type":"charslot","id":130},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#4$1","isblock":"true","id":131},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"char_249_muesys_1#4","posfrom":"100,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":132},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"char_249_muesys_1#4","focus":"r","id":133},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"真过分，你明知道我现在在谢拉格，不可能亲自来送行。","id":134,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_char_249_muesys_4.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":135},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"远距离维持水分身对你的消耗不小，这么担心我搞砸克丽斯腾的遗产？","id":136,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"char_249_muesys_1#7","focus":"r","id":137},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"我担心的不是万星园后续项目的实验进度，而是你。","id":138,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6e/Avg_char_249_muesys_7.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"char_249_muesys_1#7","focus":"r","id":139},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"种子长成树苗尚且需要时间，更何况你希望它能长成参天巨木。","id":140,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6e/Avg_char_249_muesys_7.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"char_249_muesys_1#5","focus":"r","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"放轻松点，连斐尔迪南都不会对你目前的成果挑三拣四。","id":142,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_char_249_muesys_5.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"那是因为我屏蔽了他的邮箱地址。","id":144,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"char_249_muesys_1#2","focus":"r","id":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"咳……","id":146,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_char_249_muesys_2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"char_249_muesys_1#1","focus":"r","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"在特里蒙郊外的地下，你偷偷帮着克丽斯腾实现她的梦想，现在终于轮到你自己了。","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_char_249_muesys_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"char_249_muesys_1#7","focus":"r","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"娜斯提，你有没有想过……","id":150,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6e/Avg_char_249_muesys_7.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"我不会回河谷。","id":152,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":153},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"河谷的安宁不属于一个残缺的女妖，也无法为她带来灵感。","id":154,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"char_249_muesys_1#4","focus":"r","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"可是……","id":156,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_char_249_muesys_4.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":157},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"n","id":158},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_carhorn","volume":"1","id":159},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":160},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":161},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"我该走了。","id":162,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"char_249_muesys_1#1","focus":"r","id":163},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"等一下，给。","id":164,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_char_249_muesys_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":165},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"盆栽？","id":166,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dc/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"char_249_muesys_1#1","focus":"r","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"它是我们生态科在荒漠挖到的，耐寒耐旱，跟你一样倔……就当是我送你的饯别礼吧。","id":168,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_char_249_muesys_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"char_249_muesys_1#1","focus":"r","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"不用放进生态箱，只要记得浇水就行，它会替我好好“监视”你的，说不定也会帮到你哦~","id":170,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_char_249_muesys_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":171},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"……","id":172,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"char_249_muesys_1#1","focus":"r","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"作为回礼，你只要照顾好生态园和你自己，还有——","id":174,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_char_249_muesys_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"char_249_muesys_1#5","focus":"r","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缪尔赛思","text":"要是园区商品部真出了吉祥物玩偶，记得一定要给我带一个！","id":176,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_char_249_muesys_5.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":177},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":178},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"3","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"1","block":"false","id":179},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":180},{"type":"playsound","key":"$flashback","volume":"0.8","id":181},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":182},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":183},{"type":"charslot","id":184},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","initamount":"1","amount":"0","block":"false","id":185},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":186},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_529_1#1$1","id":187},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","id":188},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bc/Avg_bg_38_g5_rhinelab_indoor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":189},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":190},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_dia_street_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta3_181101/m_dia_street_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":191,"musicid":2},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"……","id":193,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_529_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":194},{"type":"dialogue","name":"资深研究员","text":"主任，一楼生态箱内的枯枝已经全部清理好了，这盆盆栽是展区里唯一存活的植物。","id":195,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/93/Avg_avg_npc_529_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"给我吧。","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":198},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"地下区域的“植物”状况如何？","id":199,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_529_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":200},{"type":"dialogue","name":"资深研究员","text":"回传数据跟预想中一样，但监测信号覆盖不全，我们还没时间派人下去确认。","id":201,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/93/Avg_avg_npc_529_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"我去吧，辛苦。","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":204},{"type":"charslot","id":205},{"type":"dialog","id":206},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":207},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":208},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bd/Avg_bg_bg_cherunder.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":209},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":210},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":211},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":212},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_530_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":213},{"type":"dialogue","name":"地下研究员","text":"娜斯提主任。","id":214,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_npc_530_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":215},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":216},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","duration":"1","focus":"l","isblock":"true","id":217},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"有没有外人来过地下实验室？","id":218,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_530_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":219},{"type":"dialogue","name":"地下研究员","text":"没有，我们一直在这里模拟实验环境。","id":220,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_npc_530_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":221},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"嗯，以防万一……","id":222,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/db/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":223},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"（萨卡兹语）显形。","id":224,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":225},{"type":"charslot","id":226},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_magic_1","volume":"1","id":227},{"type":"delay","time":"0.8","id":228},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#5$1","id":229},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"没有其他人来过的痕迹……真的是意外？","id":230,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_530_1#1$1","id":231},{"type":"dialogue","name":"地下研究员","text":"主任，枯死植株的所有数据已经整理成了分析报告，您现在要确认吗？","id":232,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_npc_530_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","id":233},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"好，走吧。","id":234,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":235},{"type":"charslot","id":236},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.8","id":237},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":238},{"type":"playsound","key":"$keyboard","volume":"1","id":239},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":240},{"type":"dialogue","name":"电子声","text":"娜斯提·鲁诺瑞伊，工程科主任，确认权限，已开启。","id":241},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","id":242},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"……","id":243,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":244},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":245},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":246},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":247},{"type":"dialog","id":248},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":249},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":250},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":251},{"type":"charslot","id":252},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/af/Avg_bg_68_g4_floatingplatform.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":253},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":254},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":255},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$act19side_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act19side/m_sys_act19side_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":256,"musicid":3},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":257},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_901_1#1$1","id":258},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_901_1#1$1","isblock":"true","id":259},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":260},{"type":"dialogue","name":"园区警卫A","text":"该死，那两个家伙跑哪儿去了？","id":261,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_901_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":262},{"type":"charslot","id":263},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2044_1#1$1","isblock":"true","id":264},{"type":"dialogue","name":"体验员","text":"警卫先生，发生什么了？","id":265,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/67/Avg_avg_npc_2044_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":266},{"type":"charslot","id":267},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_901_1#1$1","id":268},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_901_1#1$1","isblock":"true","id":269},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":270},{"type":"dialogue","name":"园区警卫A","text":"呃……","id":271,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_901_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":272},{"type":"dialogue","name":"园区警卫B","text":"各位放心，我们只是受高登长官指示，模拟未来在影月上执行任务的情况。","id":273,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_901_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":274},{"type":"dialogue","name":"园区警卫B","text":"无论身处何方，哥伦比亚都会无条件保障公民的安全。","id":275,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_901_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":276},{"type":"dialogue","name":"园区警卫B","text":"（分头找，记得低调行事。）","id":277,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_901_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":278},{"type":"dialogue","name":"园区警卫A","text":"（是。）","id":279,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_901_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":280},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":281},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.5","isblock":"false","id":282},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":283},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":284},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":285},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2044_1#1$1","posfrom":"-200,0","charslot":"0,0","duration":"1.2","isblock":"true","id":286},{"type":"dialogue","name":"体验员","text":"原来真的是模拟演习……跟蓝卡坞大片《影月争霸》里的桥段一模一样！","id":287,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/67/Avg_avg_npc_2044_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":288},{"type":"charslot","id":289},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":290},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","isblock":"true","id":291},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":292},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"我们没骗你吧？那些警卫就是卡西米尔太空骑士，你可千万要掩护好我们啊！","id":293,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":294},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里","text":"别打哈哈了，冒牌货。接下来我们应该往哪儿跑？","id":295,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5e/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":296},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"飞天甜甜圈站的藏身之处不多，后面的环形廊道又容易被埋伏……","id":297,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2b/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":298},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里","text":"那我们难道出去送死？我俩可是签了旅行社合约的，你必须把我带出去！","id":299,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":300},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"别着急，正牌货。这儿可是“螺旋桨天堂”，忘掉地面上的逻辑。","id":301,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f6/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":302},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"先生，你正在测评的是沃尔沃特科钦斯基的滞空跳板对吧？借我们一用？","id":303,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f6/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":304},{"type":"charslot","id":305},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2044_1#1$1","isblock":"true","id":306},{"type":"dialogue","name":"体验员","text":"没问题。","id":307,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/67/Avg_avg_npc_2044_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":308},{"type":"charslot","id":309},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_hgldshcrrig","volume":"1","id":310},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crrigrunwght","volume":"1","id":311},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":312},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_901_1#1$1","id":313},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_901_1#1$1","isblock":"true","id":314},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":315},{"type":"dialogue","name":"园区警卫A","text":"嗯？什么声音？","id":316,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_901_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":317},{"type":"dialogue","name":"园区警卫B","text":"快抬头！","id":318,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_901_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":319},{"type":"dialogue","name":"园区警卫A","text":"天啊，他们怎么跑到浮空舱顶上去了？！","id":320,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_901_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":321},{"type":"charslot","id":322},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"哈，我怎么忘了，在“螺旋桨天堂”，所有人都是会抬头看的。","id":323},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里","text":"那现在怎么办！","id":324},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_901_1#1$1","id":325},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_901_1#1$1","isblock":"true","id":326},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":327},{"type":"dialogue","name":"园区警卫A","text":"把他们给我炸下来！","id":328,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_901_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":329},{"type":"charslot","id":330},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_cannon","volume":"1","id":331},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":332},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.8","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.3","block":"true","id":333},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":334},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":335},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2044_1#1$1","isblock":"true","id":336},{"type":"dialogue","name":"体验员","text":"哦——这是在模拟电影高潮段落反派使用的空气炮？","id":337,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/67/Avg_avg_npc_2044_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"体验员","text":"等等，这是源石火药的味道……","id":338,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/67/Avg_avg_npc_2044_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":339},{"type":"charslot","id":340},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_901_1#1$1","isblock":"true","id":341},{"type":"dialogue","name":"园区警卫A","text":"开火！","id":342,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_901_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":343},{"type":"charslot","id":344},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_cannon","volume":"1","id":345},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":346},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.8","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.3","block":"true","id":347},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":348},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":349},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crrigrunlght","volume":"1","id":350},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"跑啊！","id":351},{"type":"dialog","id":352},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":353},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":354},{"type":"charslot","id":355},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_bg_68_g8_gordoncollection.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":356},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":357},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":358},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":359},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#7$1","isblock":"true","id":360},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"一个两个都是废物！好不容易摁住了莱茵，又跑了一个不安分的导游……","id":361,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#7$1","isblock":"true","id":362},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"要不是接下来还有生意要做，我一定亲自去把那个菲林逮回来。","id":363,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2040_1#1$1","isblock":"true","id":364},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太空鳞兽","text":"“天空征服者”，要不要我替你解决那些愚昧的泰拉人，让他们见识一下来自外泰拉的绝对力量。","id":365,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_avg_npc_2040_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#8$1","isblock":"true","id":366},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"暂时不用，零五四。一个导游而已，又不是特工。","id":367,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#1$1","isblock":"true","id":368},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"先汇报古斯塔夫的情况。","id":369,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1d/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2040_1#1$3","isblock":"true","id":370},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太空鳞兽","text":"他跟随从一直驻守在云中餐厅和贵宾接待区，环形廊道是必经之路，但暂时没人发现暗门。","id":371,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/20/Avg_avg_npc_2040_1$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#9$1","isblock":"true","id":372},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"哈，七年前我刚进管理局工作的时候，就算只是从偷渡客裤兜里昧下一个液化源石打火机，都会被古斯塔夫发现。","id":373,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/09/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#1$1","isblock":"true","id":374},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"他是军人出身，我以为他是过于正直所以故意针对我，后来我才知道，古斯塔夫是嫌我做事不够干净。","id":375,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1d/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#3$1","isblock":"true","id":376},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"他的做派、话术，甚至这身西装我都学来了。至于成果——","id":377,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/78/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2040_1#1$2","isblock":"true","id":378},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太空鳞兽","text":"这是一间存放泰拉各地奇珍异宝的“船舱”。","id":379,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a4/Avg_avg_npc_2040_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#1$1","isblock":"true","id":380},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"比管理局肮脏的储物柜可大得多。","id":381,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1d/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#1$1","isblock":"true","id":382},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"一边是古斯塔夫，一边是娜斯提，那又如何？","id":383,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1d/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#9$1","isblock":"true","id":384},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"我可不是七年前的毛头小子了。除非我把罪证送到他们面前，不然他们这辈子都不可能发现我的手段。","id":385,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/09/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#8$1","isblock":"true","id":386},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"等到展会开始，上万件展品飞向天空，“秘密”“违规交易”……一切都不重要了。","id":387,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#2$1","isblock":"true","id":388},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"到时候所有人都会知道——不是莱茵，也不是特区政府，而是高登·谭农为“螺旋桨天堂”点了一把火。","id":389,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":390},{"type":"charslot","id":391},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crrigrunlght","volume":"1","id":392},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":393},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2040_1#1$5","isblock":"true","id":394},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太空鳞兽","text":"注意！监测到泰拉人正在靠近！","id":395,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7d/Avg_avg_npc_2040_1$5.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":396},{"type":"charslot","id":397},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_autocannon","volume":"1","id":398},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":399},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#1$1","isblock":"true","id":400},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"什么声音？","id":401,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1d/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":402},{"type":"charslot","id":403},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"别炸……底下……万一有人……","id":404},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？","text":"……花言巧语……！","id":405},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"啊……！","id":406},{"type":"dialog","id":407},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_cannon","volume":"1","id":408},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"8","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":409},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":410},{"type":"playsound","key":"$glass","volume":"1","id":411},{"type":"playsound","key":"$smallearthquake","volume":"1","id":412},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_68_i03.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0","id":413},{"type":"text","text":"一片烟雾之中，高登抬起头，使劲睁开流泪的眼睛，试图看清到底发生了什么。","id":414},{"type":"dialog","id":415},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.1","fadetime":"0.1","block":"false","id":416},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.5","fillto":"0.5","fadetime":"0.1","block":"false","id":417},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"false","id":418},{"type":"imagetween","image":"68_i03","xScaleFrom":"1","yScaleFrom":"1","xScaleTo":"1.5","yScaleTo":"1.5","xFrom":"0","yFrom":"0","xTo":"-30","yTo":"-100","duration":"0.3","block":"true","id":419},{"type":"delay","time":"0.7","id":420},{"type":"imagetween","image":"68_i03","xScaleFrom":"1.5","yScaleFrom":"1.5","xScaleTo":"1.4","yScaleTo":"1.4","duration":"10","block":"false","id":421},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_timestop","volume":"1","id":422},{"type":"text","text":"一个熟悉的人影从碎石和粉尘之中落下，四肢不受控制地挥动——几个小时前才被高登下令通缉的对象，竟然凭空出现在他面前。","id":423},{"type":"text","text":"此刻，他们的距离只有九十公分，无数思绪从两人高速运转的大脑中滑过。","id":424},{"type":"text","text":"一切似乎都静止了，高登和费尔南慌乱地捕捉对方的表情和眼神，各怀鬼胎，隔空对望。","id":425},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"（那群警卫真的说炸就炸啊！不对，这是哪里？为什么我的地图里没有标记这个地方？环形廊道还有暗门？）","id":426},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"（高登长官？怎么撞他铳口上了！这是他的圈套？可他为什么一脸惊讶地看着我，表情还那么僵硬？）","id":427},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"（墙上的东西，是展品？）","id":428},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"（不对！我当初被萨卡兹抓进黑市时，绝对在地摊上见过这种施术装置；还有那边的帽子，那不是萨尔贡墓室里长生军的标配吗……）","id":429},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"（嘶……我可能撞进不得了的地方了。现在装没看见，还来得及吗……）","id":430},{"type":"dialog","id":431},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.1","fillto":"0.2","fadetime":"0.4","block":"false","id":432},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.5","fillto":"0.3","fadetime":"0.4","block":"true","id":433},{"type":"imagetween","image":"68_i03","xScaleFrom":"1.4","yScaleFrom":"1.4","xScaleTo":"1.3","yScaleTo":"1.3","xTo":"90","yTo":"20","duration":"15","block":"false","id":434},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"（千万别撞到高能源石化合手雷，不然整个浮空舱都会玩儿完的！）","id":435},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"（他妈的，自从这个冒牌讲解员闯进园区以来就没有一件好事！）","id":436},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"（她到底是莱茵的仇人，还是娜斯提派来的间谍？每次都破坏我的计划，生态园是一次，现在又是一次。）","id":437},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"（她在看什么？活性源石风暴的引导信标，还是长生军的巫术头盔？*哥伦比亚粗口*，她认出来了！）","id":438},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"（让这么一个人抓住我的把柄，指不定她会用这个消息去跟谁交易，要是娜斯提或者古斯塔夫知道了……）","id":439},{"type":"dialog","id":440},{"type":"dialog","id":441},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":442},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":443},{"type":"curtain","id":444},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":445},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_68_i03.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":446},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":447},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":448},{"type":"text","text":"迟来的重力让费尔南迅速下坠，高登根本来不及抢救任何藏品，只能眼睁睁看着眼前的菲林女孩冲自己砸来。","id":449},{"type":"text","text":"两人的距离急速拉近，脑海里闪过的复杂念头全都消失，在撞击到来之前，两人只来得及说出一句话——","id":450},{"type":"dialog","id":451},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":452},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登&费尔南","text":"完了……","id":453},{"type":"dialog","id":454},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"2","block":"false","id":455},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_land_impact","volume":"1","block":"true","id":456},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":457},{"type":"charslot","id":458},{"type":"image","id":459},{"type":"background","id":460},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":461},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":462},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":463},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":464},{"type":"charslot","id":465},{"type":"background","id":466},{"type":"image","id":467}],"characters":["斯凯","雅斯彭","娜斯提","缪尔赛思","资深研究员","地下研究员","电子声","园区警卫A","体验员","园区警卫B","费尔南","奥克里","高登","太空鳞兽","？？？","？？","高登&费尔南"]}